--- !u!114 &570433401829709094
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1299816988128584130}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9b2e9330b6674bf0a2d99ffd0b9377f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueSequences:
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - " Good, Dr. Sanchez, you\u2019re finally awake."
      - 'Unfortunately, this will not be a pleasant wake-up call. '
      - 'There is concerning information to be shared. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - However, in an effort to maintain procedures, we must first complete preliminary
        tests.
      - "Please don\u2019t be alarmed by the absence of a floor."
      - 'Remember, you are in zero gravity. '
      - 'Exam part A: <Roll Out of Bed> begin.'
      - Please start by grabbing onto a bar within reach.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - "Now, to re-acclimate to our ship\u2019s environment. Roll left."
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - Roll yourself back.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - Exam part A complete. Getting better acquainted?
      - Remember, if you ever feel uncomfortable. It is advised to stop, take a breath,
        and roll to a view that feels best.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Proceeding with exam part B: <Dexterity Evaluation>'
      - Please, again, grab and hold onto a bar within your reach. Then, get comfortable
        moving around the chamber.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Exam part B complete. Well done Dr. Sanchez. You''ll get the swing of it
        soon enough. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - On to the news.
      - The alan system has failed to reboot. Primary functions are completely severed.
      - Printing and reviewing MODUS log.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - ...
      - No information for the cause of the alan crash.
      - In short, we both have awoken equally lost.
      - Apologies, Dr. Sanchez. This is a bit concerning.
      - ...
      - Procedure instructs us to reconnect all alan terminals, one by one.
      - "It shouldn\u2019t be too difficult for you to handle."
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 2
    audioSource: {fileID: 5041868246080924205}
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - Get your wrist monitor from your dorm. We'll begin there.
      - Good luck, Dr. Sanchez.
      - 'Let us go forward together. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    audioSource: {fileID: 5041868246080924205}
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - 'First alan terminal restored, Thank you, Dr. Valentina Sanchez! :] '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 2
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - Check your wrist monitor. You seem a little depleted.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 4
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - 'A common side effect. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
      delayBetweenLines: 2
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - We can get a remedy in the Medical Bay.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 2
    audioSource: {fileID: 8312900905558097330}
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - Medical Bay alan reboot successful. Bravo.
      - Now you may use the amenities.
      - 'Use an e-stim to nurse your headache. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
      delayBetweenLines: 1.3
    audioSource: {fileID: 6211000333437576532}
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - That ought to make you feel chipper.
      - Last terminal is in the Dining Room.
      - Unlocked the door. Use it to go through the Maintenance Tunnel.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
      delayBetweenLines: 1.5
    audioSource: {fileID: 6211000333437576532}
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Congratulations, Dr. Sanchez. all Living Quarters alan terminals are back
        online. '
      - And in proper working order. Better than expected.
      - Printing and reviewing MODUS log.
      - ...
      - Again, nothing about the alan crash. Disappointing.
      - "Afraid we\u2019ll have to keep searching. "
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1.5
      delayBetweenLines: 1.5
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Crap, '
      - a manual lockdown is active. The doors out of the Living Quarters are locked.
      - 'It was initiated in the Server Farm. But, the door to it is obstructed with
        malware. '
      - "It won\u2019t open. Searching for solutions."
      - ...
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
      delayBetweenLines: 2
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Got an idea. '
      - 'Surging the door, hopefully, will force it open. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 3
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - Oops, that was not intended.
      - "You\u2019ll need to make it through."
      - 'Please be careful. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0.5
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    audioSource: {fileID: 1930374705737171332}
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: alan:\
      dialogueLines:
      - The manual lockdown has been lifted, and we can now continue to the Vocational
        Wing.
      - One more thing.
      - Dr. Tadesse's vitals...
      - Untraceable. Condolences.
      - Proceed with caution.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 2
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    audioSource: {fileID: 7535123749138554315}
  failureDialogues:
    dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'My sensors detected that you were not successful. Hopefully, you only sustain
        a bruise. You may still be unsteady from your long nap.  '
      - "I\u2019ll mark the exam as complete given the circumstances. I do advise
        you to take some more time to practice this maneuver."
      - "You\u2019ll get the swing of it soon, I promise. "
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 30ec8ae17b41c804198239de9eeff5b6, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 1
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - Very funny, Dr. Sanchez. There are many ways to do the same thing.
      - Please humor me and do it by rolling.
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4e9c601bf19d8b4ebd3787bf2540dae, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
      delayBetweenLines: 1
    audioSource: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueCanvas: {fileID: 5240964599136707795}
  dialogueCanvasGroup: {fileID: 2494902762060485070}
  nameTextUI: {fileID: 7291282962655030634}
  dialogueTextUI: {fileID: 6289586018938929987}
  defaultAudioSource: {fileID: 6924546150987722323}
  sourceList: []
  fillerLineBeep: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a989c7f9085d344fb1468f00038ac0f, type: 3}
  defaultTextSpeed: 0.04
  textSpeedMultiplier: 1.6
  dialogueAudio: {fileID: 846606584158585287}
  fadeDuration: 0.5
  skipPauseDuration: 0.3
  tutorialManager: {fileID: 4903747839970536017}
  player: {fileID: 7920395848503252936}
  playerManager: {fileID: 0}
  sfxSource: {fileID: 5582885019622376082}
  skipSfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46da25644e12c82429d79846cec77d46, type: 3}
